(6728317, 1007253, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I enjoy how they fill the frame but don''t cross the threshold, and also how they frame the fishermen. Super sharp, and vivid colors. Very nice.</td>', 'Great capture. I enjoy how they fill the frame but don''t cross the threshold, and also how they frame the fishermen. Super sharp, and vivid colors. Very nice.', '2012-04-01 09:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
