(6728339, 1007564, 108069, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. What a great capture. Well seen, and even the minor details take it further, like the alignment of the bricks in the frame, the line of shade, and how her boot, though in the sun, intersects that line. It''s a study of contrasts through and through. Awesome shot.</td>', 'Hilarious. What a great capture. Well seen, and even the minor details take it further, like the alignment of the bricks in the frame, the line of shade, and how her boot, though in the sun, intersects that line. It''s a study of contrasts through and through. Awesome shot.', '2012-04-01 09:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6728340, 1006945, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent processing. Tremendous amount of depth, and the whites sparkle in an otherwise fairly gloomy, moody scene. Fantastic photo.</td>', 'Excellent processing. Tremendous amount of depth, and the whites sparkle in an otherwise fairly gloomy, moody scene. Fantastic photo.', '2012-04-01 09:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
