(6729713, 1006476, 37629, '<td valign="top">I can see the abstraction you were going for but you need to include more of the figure and restructure to composition if you want it to have that sexy appeal I think you were going for. (i assume because I think it''s a woman in a bra) sometimes this sort of thing works well and a lot of the time I find colours to be a huge asset to achieve success. I think were it goes awry is the weird way the shoulder is jutting up and out there, kind of ...what. lol.</td>', 'I can see the abstraction you were going for but you need to include more of the figure and restructure to composition if you want it to have that sexy appeal I think you were going for. (i assume because I think it''s a woman in a bra) sometimes this sort of thing works well and a lot of the time I find colours to be a huge asset to achieve success. I think were it goes awry is the weird way the shoulder is jutting up and out there, kind of ...what. lol.', '2012-04-02 13:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729722, 1007537, 37629, '<td valign="top">this is the least boring photo of all of the 187 canadian geese photos I have seen.</td>', 'this is the least boring photo of all of the 187 canadian geese photos I have seen.', '2012-04-02 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729731, 1006611, 37629, '<td valign="top">what a strong photo and good pose. If you played with the levels a little bit in photoshop and brought out the mid tones a little bit more so some of the flatness went away it''d be absolutely stunning. The rule of thirds is a little bit off as well, only slightly but I think it works for this photo. If you were to edit the levels I would be careful because the pastels in the colours as so lovely. great image.</td>', 'what a strong photo and good pose. If you played with the levels a little bit in photoshop and brought out the mid tones a little bit more so some of the flatness went away it''d be absolutely stunning. The rule of thirds is a little bit off as well, only slightly but I think it works for this photo. If you were to edit the levels I would be careful because the pastels in the colours as so lovely. great image.', '2012-04-02 13:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729740, 1007159, 37629, '<td valign="top">this is a great photo. It makes me feel good inside.</td>', 'this is a great photo. It makes me feel good inside.', '2012-04-02 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
