(6731232, 1007609, 142599, '<td valign="top">I almost marked this low , because its depressing , but im making myself see things differently lately . I want to take in all that the artist is trying to relate to the viewer . this is very amazing . I see the well manicured nails and tattooed arm running up to a looks to be pretty face . but it doesn''t matter what you look like on the outside, it how you feel on the inside . at least that''s what I get from this image.I give it a 9 :)nice work !</td>', 'I almost marked this low , because its depressing , but im making myself see things differently lately . I want to take in all that the artist is trying to relate to the viewer . this is very amazing . I see the well manicured nails and tattooed arm running up to a looks to be pretty face . but it doesn''t matter what you look like on the outside, it how you feel on the inside . at least that''s what I get from this image.I give it a 9 :)nice work !', '2012-04-03 13:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
