(6733088, 1007436, 114233, '<td valign="top">What an image! Going through the entries this one really grabs your attention :-)<br/> <br/>Rian I what it took to get a shot like this. I''m not sure if this is the exact way you pictured it in your mind''s eye but what I do know is that it is an awesome shot. Panning with a long lens, using a fast enough shutter speed to keep bird and land sharp with the right amount of DOF... well done Mnr! And all of this whilst shivering to keep warm and after a nice hike to get to the top as well. The height from which this has been shot to overlook the mountain ranges / peaks below with the clouds rolling in and the gorgeous soft light - THIS MENEER is what the mountains are about and you have captured it magnificently!<br/> <br/>A fave for your efforts and my viewing pleasure!</td>', 'What an image! Going through the entries this one really grabs your attention :-) Rian I what it took to get a shot like this. I''m not sure if this is the exact way you pictured it in your mind''s eye but what I do know is that it is an awesome shot. Panning with a long lens, using a fast enough shutter speed to keep bird and land sharp with the right amount of DOF... well done Mnr! And all of this whilst shivering to keep warm and after a nice hike to get to the top as well. The height from which this has been shot to overlook the mountain ranges / peaks below with the clouds rolling in and the gorgeous soft light - THIS MENEER is what the mountains are about and you have captured it magnificently! A fave for your efforts and my viewing pleasure!', '2012-04-05 07:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
