(6735052, 1005263, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great find. Personally though I think you can do much better with it, by finding a different perspective or getting in close to let the age of the bridge do the storytelling.<br/> <br/>The foreground branches are a bit distracting, and then the wires really take a bit of the charm away. The reflection is quite nice, but I feel as though the goal to incorporate that has added other distracting/detracting elements.<br/> <br/>Just a thought, but I''d get to this same spot/subject and really explore other perspectives and framing options, as you''re on to something, but I feel as though this one leaves just a bit more desired by the viewer.</td>', 'Great find. Personally though I think you can do much better with it, by finding a different perspective or getting in close to let the age of the bridge do the storytelling. The foreground branches are a bit distracting, and then the wires really take a bit of the charm away. The reflection is quite nice, but I feel as though the goal to incorporate that has added other distracting/detracting elements. Just a thought, but I''d get to this same spot/subject and really explore other perspectives and framing options, as you''re on to something, but I feel as though this one leaves just a bit more desired by the viewer.', '2012-04-07 13:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
