(6735533, 1007159, 137320, '<td valign="top">I scored this pretty high for a few reasons. I love the framing/cropping of it, and what appears to be dirt being kicked up near the ground adds to the whole misty forest kind of feel here. 8</td>', 'I scored this pretty high for a few reasons. I love the framing/cropping of it, and what appears to be dirt being kicked up near the ground adds to the whole misty forest kind of feel here. 8', '2012-04-08 00:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6735536, 1007505, 137320, '<td valign="top">With the tones being in my opinion pretty conservative in saturation, I still really love this. The scope of it all. There are so many things to look at and they all work so well together. One of my faves.</td>', 'With the tones being in my opinion pretty conservative in saturation, I still really love this. The scope of it all. There are so many things to look at and they all work so well together. One of my faves.', '2012-04-08 00:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
