(6736144, 1007448, 39184, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot and post processing.  A new fave!<br/> <br/><i>edit to add</i>:  You didn''t appear to have any problems with haze and the associated lack of contrast in the mid to distant hills as I did in my recent trip to New Zealand.  Was there any haze or did you overcome it in post processing?  It would be interesting to see one of the original images.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-08 13:07:50.</i></td>', 'Awesome shot and post processing.  A new fave! edit to add:  You didn''t appear to have any problems with haze and the associated lack of contrast in the mid to distant hills as I did in my recent trip to New Zealand.  Was there any haze or did you overcome it in post processing?  It would be interesting to see one of the original images.', '2012-04-08 14:05:03.000000', '2012-04-08 14:07:50.000000', 0),
