(6736387, 1007597, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is one of those under appreciated shots. I think it deserved a little higher finish in the challenge. The comparison to commenter scores verses the rest tells a story. I think you got digned because of the cross-processed color look. DPC doesn''t really go for the Lomo or cross-processing in general.I like it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-08 18:34:49.</i></td>', 'This is one of those under appreciated shots. I think it deserved a little higher finish in the challenge. The comparison to commenter scores verses the rest tells a story. I think you got digned because of the cross-processed color look. DPC doesn''t really go for the Lomo or cross-processing in general.I like it!', '2012-04-08 19:34:26.000000', '2012-04-08 19:34:49.000000', 0),
(6736392, 1004844, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is nothing "wrong" with this picture, Scott.  For me, the image lacks context, however.  This happens a lot to everyone.  We see something that we really like, especially when we know the backstory, or are familiar with the environment, or it has some sort of history. Thus for US, the image contains a lot more information that it does for the uninformed viewer. <br/> <br/>In addition, the most salient feature of the image is the tree, which breaks up the rocks and the horizon, however, it is mostly hidden, and it is rather featureless.  Add to that a comparatively large and empty foreground and...</td>', 'There is nothing "wrong" with this picture, Scott.  For me, the image lacks context, however.  This happens a lot to everyone.  We see something that we really like, especially when we know the backstory, or are familiar with the environment, or it has some sort of history. Thus for US, the image contains a lot more information that it does for the uninformed viewer.  In addition, the most salient feature of the image is the tree, which breaks up the rocks and the horizon, however, it is mostly hidden, and it is rather featureless.  Add to that a comparatively large and empty foreground and...', '2012-04-08 19:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
