(6736401, 1004844, 54645, '<td valign="top">I would say you got lost in the processing and you were left with a halo above the horizon and tree. <br/> <br/>There is enough context and detail in the scene to be interesting, but the arrangement via composition falls flat. It should "feel" dynamic.<br/> <br/>ETA:   I now see that it is a single tree in the distance with darker trees in front of it! <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-08 23:46:43.</i></td>', 'I would say you got lost in the processing and you were left with a halo above the horizon and tree.  There is enough context and detail in the scene to be interesting, but the arrangement via composition falls flat. It should "feel" dynamic. ETA:   I now see that it is a single tree in the distance with darker trees in front of it! ', '2012-04-08 20:10:11.000000', '2012-04-09 00:46:43.000000', 0),
