(6737055, 1007505, 96664, '<td valign="top">Color is lacking! Looks like a heck of a sunset/rise but the colors aren''t there? I wonder what the original image looked like before editing. I wonder if you could have done a gradient style of edit to pop the colors of the sky more. I think that if there were more dramatic oranges and reds then this would have done a whole lot better. Oh, and I know some people don''t bother with this but the rule of thirds is nonexistent in this shot. But rule of thirds is just personal preference for me.</td>', 'Color is lacking! Looks like a heck of a sunset/rise but the colors aren''t there? I wonder what the original image looked like before editing. I wonder if you could have done a gradient style of edit to pop the colors of the sky more. I think that if there were more dramatic oranges and reds then this would have done a whole lot better. Oh, and I know some people don''t bother with this but the rule of thirds is nonexistent in this shot. But rule of thirds is just personal preference for me.', '2012-04-09 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 0),
