(6737116, 1007505, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful view with a great sky.  As someone in the threat mentioned, maybe a slightly more dynamic comp/crop?  And the land is a bit dark but that works if you bring out the road a bit more.  Try that with the shot in mono and see how it looks.</td>', 'Wonderful view with a great sky.  As someone in the threat mentioned, maybe a slightly more dynamic comp/crop?  And the land is a bit dark but that works if you bring out the road a bit more.  Try that with the shot in mono and see how it looks.', '2012-04-09 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
