(6740435, 1006647, 146510, '<td valign="top">Thanks Snaffles. Funny enough this place is usually filled with people. However, it was really cold when I took this shot and the area was desserted. I did use a tripod though with a cable release to prevent motion blur.<br/> <br/>Thank you for the kind and constructive comments. It certainly helps and is much appreciated.</td>', 'Thanks Snaffles. Funny enough this place is usually filled with people. However, it was really cold when I took this shot and the area was desserted. I did use a tripod though with a cable release to prevent motion blur. Thank you for the kind and constructive comments. It certainly helps and is much appreciated.', '2012-04-13 05:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
