(6803207, 1004341, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is more a comment on your notes, than the photo (though the photo is very nice, as well). <br/>I came to the same notion regarding people flitting about and "seeing" things by flying over them, or going through places in such a quick fashion. I see that the most in people who are obsessed with summitting mountains. I much prefer doing all the routes on a mountain, learning its intricacies, spending time, learning the character of it. I''m glad there are others that are the same.</td>', 'This is more a comment on your notes, than the photo (though the photo is very nice, as well). I came to the same notion regarding people flitting about and "seeing" things by flying over them, or going through places in such a quick fashion. I see that the most in people who are obsessed with summitting mountains. I much prefer doing all the routes on a mountain, learning its intricacies, spending time, learning the character of it. I''m glad there are others that are the same.', '2012-06-27 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6807163, 1007597, 49773, '<td valign="top">I like the man''s arm position, it''s quite relaxed and natural. The only problem I see is that the woman is kinda looking at it, thus giving it more attention than needed. Unless...</td>', 'I like the man''s arm position, it''s quite relaxed and natural. The only problem I see is that the woman is kinda looking at it, thus giving it more attention than needed. Unless...', '2012-07-02 22:25:04.000000', NULL, 0),
