(7119366, 1002108, 108580, '<td valign="top">Anyone who shoots birds (feathered kind or not) is ok in my books :)Wonderful form, bokeh and catch light. I''d maybe work a bit on the gloss and denoise of it as that is what DPC wants. Then again who am I to judge? My wild birds battle to ribbon here...</td>', 'Anyone who shoots birds (feathered kind or not) is ok in my books :)Wonderful form, bokeh and catch light. I''d maybe work a bit on the gloss and denoise of it as that is what DPC wants. Then again who am I to judge? My wild birds battle to ribbon here...', '2013-10-21 08:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
